bgload SIRO.jpg 47
text I'm looking at it.
text A distant world.
music BGM26B.mp3
setvar strS[1000] = "BG301"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s3
fi
goto 4
label s3
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 4
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text It's a dim, dark place.
text Where could this be?
text I think I'm inside a room.
text It's deserted, though.
text I can see a desk at least.
text Someone should be sitting there, but they're not.
text Not a thing here moves...
text Only time, as it passes by unflinchingly.
text ......
text If I were a new life, searching for a place to be born...
text I think that this would be the wrong place to choose.
text I'm frightened by it, this world.
text I've long since come to realize something:
text This world has already come to an end.
text Nothing will be born here again, nor will anything die.
text Even time doesn't exist in this place.
text Nothing new can come to an end.
text Life was once born here, but that was all.
text Once you're shut in this never-ending world, you can't ever escape.
text Unable to die and unable to be born into a new world.
text That is the frozen world I now see.
text I'll just close my eyes and leave this place...
text That's my thinking, anyway.
text Please... Next time I wake up, don't let it be here...
text Let it be a better, warmer world.
text I move my eyes...
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s4
fi
goto 5
label s4
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 5
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text And cut myself off from this world.
text ......
setvar strS[1000] = "BG301"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s5
fi
goto 6
label s5
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 6
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Just then, I see a momentary flicker of light.
text Something moved.
text I don't know what it is.
text But I'm certain that something's here with me.
text Had this place not come to an end after all...?
text ...Or is it just something that's already been living here?
text Light escapes through a window and reaches the wall in front of me.
text Something in its shadows is moving.
text Perhaps I would've seen it if I'd been able to move my "eyes."
text But I still don't know its true identity.
text It's moving slowly...
text Eventually, the light on the wall returns to its original shape...
text But then out of nowhere, a single girl appears before me.
text I can tell that she's still innocent.
text Her eyes are transfixed in my direction.
text Can she see me?
text She holds out her hand.
text ...But it doesn't touch me. Instead, it goes right through.
text Yes...
text I haven't been born in this world.
text So I can't be touched.
text But in that case... how did the girl notice me?
text Am I simply visible and that's it?
text If that IS the case, what do I look like then?
text The girl has pulled back her hand and is now waving to me.
text Then, she leaves.
text I can't see her anymore.
text ...Someone was here. In this place.
text What could she be doing in an already finished world?
text How does she live; what nourishes her?
text What, if anything, is letting her stay alive?
text For some reason, I can't stop thinking about her.
text Is it because of how different this place is...?
text I'm still frightened.
text ...This is not a world to be born into.
text But a girl lives in it.
text Is that why...?
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s6
fi
goto 7
label s6
setvar strS[1000] = ""
