	fi
fi
text I see this world again.
text Much of it is a boring, unmoving place.
text But from time to time, a girl appears.
text She and I are unable to communicate our thoughts to one another.
text So all she does is look at me; and all I can do is look at her back.
text But I'm certain...
text ...that I had been longing for this moment.
text The girl's life is one of solitude.
text There's no one here aside from her.
text That much is obvious.
text Like I said, nothing can be born here, and yet, nothing can die.
text That's the nature of this place.
text That must be why.
text ...Why she's able to look at someone like me yet never get bored.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s8
fi
goto 9
label s8
setvar strS[1000] = ""
