setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 10
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text One day, the girl appears in front of me with her arms full of something.
text They're pieces, both large and small... of scrap.
text Items whose uses are unknown... Things that could only be described as "junk."
text The girl spends a long time putting the junk together.
text How much time has passed, anyway?
text Before I know it though, a doll stands in front of her, about half her height.
text She seems proud as she stands up, turning toward me.
text When I see her face, I finally come to a realization:
text That body is for me.
text But what am I supposed to do with it?
text I'm unsure.
text Should I wish?
text To be born into this world?
text Has that been my wish?
text I'm still afraid of this place.
text A world without life or death...
text ...that can never be escaped.
text If this world truly is that closed off...
text This is where I would come to an end.
text The girl has her arm outstretched...
text I stare at her scraped and scratched hand.
text This world's... one source of warmth.
text At some point...
text @It had become what I sought.
delay 180
music ~
